Unnamed tuples are not split
   ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
   ┃ t           ┃
   ┡━━━━━━━━━━━━━┩
1. │ (1,'world') │
   └─────────────┘
Named tuples nested inside other types are not split
   ┌─arr────────┐
1. │ [{        ↴│
   │↳  "x": 1, ↴│
   │↳  "y": "a"↴│
   │↳}]         │
   └────────────┘
Disabled: JSON rendering inside the cell
   ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
   ┃ t              ┃
   ┡━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┩
